<title>NETHERLANDS: PHILIPS Q2 EARNINGS MORE THAN DOUBLE.</title>
<headline>PHILIPS Q2 EARNINGS MORE THAN DOUBLE.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips Electronics NV said on Thursday net profit from ordinary operations rose to 693 million guilders in the second quarter of 1997 from 304 million in the same period of 1996.</p>
</text>
